# Normalize line endings to LF in the working tree on every platform.
#
# Several conformance scripts (private-witness-demo.mjs, clean-checkout-conformance.mjs)
# compare generated output against committed files byte-for-byte. On Windows,
# core.autocrlf=true rewrote those files to CRLF on checkout, making the byte
# comparison fail even though the committed blobs are correct (CI on Linux is
# green). Forcing eol=lf keeps the working tree identical to the committed
# blobs everywhere, so the contribution chain runs on any platform.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be touched by line-ending normalization.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.solc binary
